  "html": "<p>其他惨剧轮回网站\n</p><p>官方网站<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://bakafire.main.jp/rooper/sr_top.htm\">https://bakafire.main.jp/rooper/sr_top.htm</a>\n</p><p>日文wiki <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://w.atwiki.jp/rooper/pages/1.html\">https://w.atwiki.jp/rooper/pages/1.html</a>\n</p><p>日文剧本站 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.boardgame.work/sangeki/\">http://www.boardgame.work/sangeki/</a>\n</p><p>英文剧本站 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://tragedy-looper.github.io/\">https://tragedy-looper.github.io/</a>\n</p><p>剧本生成器 <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://alephtwo.github.io/tragedy-looper-generator/\">https://alephtwo.github.io/tragedy-looper-generator/</a>\n</p><p>中文剧本交流群 640123142（密码请向管理员询问）\n</p><p>联机网页版 \n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://rooper-401ef.web.app/\">https://rooper-401ef.web.app/</a> \n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.tragedy-loope-pc.top/\">https://www.tragedy-loope-pc.top/</a> \n</p><p>自助惨网页版（开发者@桶子） \n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://120.46.90.127/\">http://120.46.90.127/</a>\n</p><p>中文自动结算网页版（测试中）\n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://github.com/losinphantom/tragedy-looper-web\">https://github.com/losinphantom/tragedy-looper-web</a>\n</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://117.72.209.60:5173/\">http://117.72.209.60:5173/</a>\n</p><p>管理员邮箱 xinshouzhier@gmail.com\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached t